      },
      "description": "Native media slideshow with LAN uploads, named collections and shared settings.",
      "compatibility_notes": "Requires Python 3.9+, Tk 8.6, Pillow >=10.4,<13, qrcode >=7.4,<9 and installed packaging for App Center dependency checks. Optional system ffmpeg/ffprobe must decode VP8, VP9 and WebP; one-click setup requires the Shell multimedia helper. PocketCHIP playback, uploads and keyboard controls were tested from staged source with the Shell VSync compositor. Managed App Center update to this version was not physically exercised.",
